Reply with JSON only, in this form:
{"steps":["<step 1>","<step 2>"]}
Keep every reply under 300 words. Answer in English."},{"role":"user","content":"Task: Make a packing list for a weekend camping trip near Brno. Plan exactly three steps: one to check the weather forecast for Brno, one to list the things to pack for that weather, and a last step that puts the final short list together."}],"response_format":{"type":"json_schema","json_schema":{"name":"reply","strict":false,"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"steps":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["steps"]}}}}
